{"version":1,"content":"<p>作為全球規模最大、工藝最先進的半導體製造商，台積電在SRAM微縮方面的進展已停滯多年。自2020年N5 5納米工藝量產以來，6T SRAM存儲單元的面積一直停留在約0.021平方微米。邏輯元件的電晶體密度持續提升，存儲器卻沒能跟上同樣的步伐。隨着計劃於2028年投產的A14節點登場，這一局面有望被打破：</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583950.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:30.171230+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T17:55:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:08.247462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:08.247462+00:00","content_hash":"b04fe23e73b5eb6987f420cc2317fc8ad0f52405c768a8043c99e432dc861c9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}